  "description": "A section names a formal unit of the music. Unlike a rehearsal mark, it states what the music is: renaming \"Chorus\" to \"Verse\" changes the description of the piece's form. A section extends until the next one begins. Proposed MNX objects, not yet adopted — see roadmap/proposed/score-text.md.",
